  "whatsapp_greeting": "Hello! I am the Pediatric Vaccination & Drug Assistant (IAP 2023).\n\nI can help with:\n\ud83d\udc89 Next vaccines due & catch-up schedule\n\ud83d\udc8a Drug doses with weight-based calculation\n\ud83d\udccb Treatment plans for common conditions\n\u26a0\ufe0f Special precautions for CKD/Nephrotic/Transplant\n\nPlease share the child's age and weight to get started!",
